# JARVIS configuration example — copy to .env (never committed)
# Full variable reference: see README "Environment variables".

# Local server bind (loopback-only is enforced; other hosts are refused)
# JARVIS_HOST=127.0.0.1
# JARVIS_PORT=8080

# SQLite location (defaults to data/jarvis.db inside the project)
# JARVIS_DB_PATH=data/jarvis.db

# AI provider (a local/proxied OpenAI-compatible catalog endpoint)
# FREELLMAPI_URL=https://your-provider.example/v1
# FREELLMAPI_API_KEY=your-key-here     <- keep .env out of git; this file must stay key-free

# Skills directory (SKILL.md manifests; sandboxed execution needs bwrap)
# JARVIS_SKILLS_DIR=/home/you/.config/jarvis/skills

# Updates: https JSON source + explicit install target.
# Unset target keeps JARVIS in report-only mode (refuses to install).
# JARVIS_UPDATE_SOURCE=https://your-update-source.example/latest.json
# JARVIS_UPDATE_TARGET=/opt/jarvis
